WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
You were at Africelle, and Hubert was missing.

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.660
Besides, you three weren’t there.

3
00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.940
You three talked to us a lot today.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:09.660
You three?

5
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.320
Yeah, you three. There’s Hubert who didn’t speak, the Ear who told us.

6
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.640
Ah, me too, he didn’t speak.

7
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:15.840
You too, you didn’t speak.

8
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:16.900
I spoke yesterday.

9
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.380
Ha, ha, ha.

10
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.880
True, you spoke yesterday.
